Explanation: ADR-0155: the series of stack.md. unattended-upgrades installs each version of it, and
Explanation: a new series waits until stack.md fixes it.
Package: caddy
Pin: version 2.11.*
Pin-Priority: 990

Explanation: ADR-0155: no other version, neither another series nor the caddy of Debian 13. The
Explanation: first record that matches a version gives its priority: without the series, apt fails.
Package: caddy
Pin: version *
Pin-Priority: -1
